<BaseLayout title="FAQ">
  <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

  <h2>Will the tooth powder stain my sink?</h2>
  <p>Our blend uses natural earth-toned ingredients. Simply rinse or wipe the sink after brushing to prevent staining.</p>

  <h2>How often can I use it?</h2>
  <p>Use twice daily, or at least once at night after dinner. Avoid eating afterward for best results.</p>

  <h2>Can kids use it?</h2>
  <p>Yes, under adult supervision. Remind them not to dip the toothbrush directly into the jar — use a clean spoon or dish instead.</p>
</BaseLayout>
